      "content": "but being \"held by it\" just feels like drowning. it's just more of the same. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i could just... stop the weight. if i didn't have to feel it anymore. it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just exit the conversation entirely. like, there's no logical way to be \"still here\" and not be crushed by this.",
